{"note_id": "NOTE-20261127-fee98e", "path": "readings/2026-11-27-thought-memory-self-enhancement-selection-temporal-appraisal.md", "session_id": "SESSION-20261127-1ab166", "created_at": "2026-11-27", "mode": "acquisition", "quadrant": "AB_crossed", "return_status": "returned_to_core", "read_depth": "excerpt_and_metadata_read", "cognitive_operation": "inference", "claims": [{"claim_id": "CLM-NOTE-20261127-fee98e-1", "kind": "reading_maintained", "text": "人間の自己は個別の記憶・思考を消去せず、痕跡を残したまま評価・検索のトラフィックを迂回・再配分する。", "anchor": "§2", "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-002"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261127-076198", "MAT-20261127-fa1e44", "MAT-20261127-e9c74d", "MAT-20261127-12dd95", "MAT-20261127-8d82d5", "MAT-20261127-263c75", "MAT-20261127-86a920", "MAT-20261127-eceb69", "MAT-20261127-7a178a", "MAT-20261127-cf9199"], "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261122-970bed", "HYP-20261122-f38498"]}, {"claim_id": "CLM-NOTE-20261127-fee98e-2", "kind": "reading_maintained", "text": "記憶は自己を構成するが自己同一性の核（本質）ではなく、道徳的特質や「自己であるという感覚」の方が自己の持続を支える。", "anchor": "§2.3", "question_ids": ["Q-001"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261127-86a920", "MAT-20261127-eceb69"], "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261122-970bed", "HYP-20261122-f38498"]}], "salience": 2, "reason": "自己高揚・動機づけによる記憶の選別と時間的自己評価を通じて、個別の思考・記憶と自己の関係を記録する。"}
